ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2404970/extras/505877c04e9efcb2a7342cc41bba03d4.mp4?t=1752536431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 Different Endings Based On What You Want Most</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIND YOUR DIMENSION BEFORE TIME RUNS OUT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been selected to participate in an experiment where you can make your wildest dream come true! You can be taken to a dimension where you are the most wealthy, the most powerful, or the most happy. The only catch is you can't stop once you've started - and you have to reach the end before the time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you reach your chosen dimension, do you really think it will be everything you've ever wanted?</p>",
